{"id":"n62013-1-10","stage":3,"title":"대립 · 对立","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62013-1-10-1","ko":"큰일이야. 의견이 크게 나눠졌네.","zh":"糟了。大家的意见分歧好大啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"큰일이야.","meaning":"大事","explanation":"큰일：大事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"큰일","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72174","senseId":"2","lemma":"큰일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰일이야","audio":"/audio/e042f6160a32bc16205d.mp3"}},{"text":"의견이","meaning":"意见","explanation":"의견：意见；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"의견","audio":"/audio/1eaed37a207480d88b78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71118","senseId":"1","lemma":"의견","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"의견이","audio":"/audio/19dc6bac42d67623b96a.mp3"}},{"text":"크게","meaning":"重，重大，严重","explanation":"크다：重，重大，严重；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"3","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"크게","audio":"/audio/39efead98c7d3ec847e3.mp3"}},{"text":"나눠졌네.","meaning":"分为，分成；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"나누다：分为，分成；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"나누다","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29749","senseId":"1","lemma":"나누다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나눠졌네","audio":"/audio/a16272720fd69cb1cc69.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dbfb08997ec518d3","term":"큰일","zh":"大事","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3","entryId":"72174","definition":"无法挽回的大事故或不好的事情。","pronunciation":["크닐"]},{"id":"1eaed37a207480d8","term":"의견","zh":"意见","audio":"/audio/1eaed37a207480d88b78.mp3","entryId":"71118","definition":"对某个对象或现象等有自己的判断和想法。","pronunciation":["의ː견"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"重，重大，严重","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"某事的规模、范围、程度、力量等都超过了一般水平。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"8a88d2ae9895b06e","term":"나누다","zh":"分为，分成","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3","entryId":"29749","definition":"使原来的一个整体变成两个以上的部分或碎块。","pronunciation":["나누다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e485955ef0261abcfe4d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62013-1-10-2","ko":"응. 양쪽 생각이 계속 대립을 보이고 있어.","zh":"是啊，双方的看法一直存在对立。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"양쪽","meaning":"两边，两面","explanation":"양쪽：两边，两面","readings":[{"term":"양쪽","audio":"/audio/8feecc0efe0a7438a705.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67234","senseId":"1","lemma":"양쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"양쪽","audio":"/audio/8feecc0efe0a7438a705.mp3"}},{"text":"생각이","meaning":"想法，念头，心思","explanation":"생각：想法，念头，心思；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"5","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각이","audio":"/audio/4cbc2bb73481851c34fc.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"대립을","meaning":"对立，相对","explanation":"대립：对立，相对；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"대립","audio":"/audio/28744173b11b2832e413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62013","senseId":"1","lemma":"대립","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대립을","audio":"/audio/21667c69f0d5362bb320.mp3"}},{"text":"보이고","meaning":"显露，露出","explanation":"보이다：显露，露出；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"2","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이고","audio":"/audio/683be65ef5399a6b3144.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"8feecc0efe0a7438","term":"양쪽","zh":"两边，两面","audio":"/audio/8feecc0efe0a7438a705.mp3","entryId":"67234","definition":"两个面。","pronunciation":["양ː쪽"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想法，念头，心思","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"对某事持有意见或感受。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"28744173b11b2832","term":"대립","zh":"对立，相对","audio":"/audio/28744173b11b2832e413.mp3","entryId":"62013","definition":"想法、意见或立场相反或不一致。","pronunciation":["대ː립"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"显露，露出","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"观察对象而了解其内容或状态。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},